0..73 Comment "// Function extensionality at data types, the HoTT book\'s § 2.9 with the"
74..151 Comment "// types read as in § 2.12: a data type is the sum of its constructors, each"
152..227 Comment "// the product of its fields, so two functions on shapes that agree at each"
228..305 Comment "// constructor over fresh fields are one path, and two that return data agree"
306..359 Comment "// when their results do, constructor by constructor."
361..438 Comment "// The shapes, the figures and `Shapes.toFigure`, the map from the one to the"
439..448 Comment "// other."
